frais officiels et honoraires d’agents de brevets. 2 · AVOCATS — Les conseils juridiques en propriété intellectuelle qui protègent le dossier. 3 · DOMAINE — Le nom de domaine du site et ses renouvellements. 4 · SITE — Le développement du site : outils, hébergement, et ce qui le fait prospérer. 5 · RECHERCHE — L’approfondissement des recherches : vérifications aux sources, preuves et ancrages publics. 6 · CONFORMITÉ — Garder le site conforme aux lois qu’il enseigne, à commencer par la Loi 25. 7 · BESOIN — Là où le besoin est le plus grand, au choix du chercheur.","mots":["2","a","quoi","peut","servir","votre","argent","la","liste","voici","tout","ce","qu","un","don","peut","servir","chaque","usage","porte","un","code","c","est","ce","code","que","vous","ecrivez","dans","le","message","de","votre","virement","section","suivante","1","brevet","l","avis","de","brevetabilite","et","le","depot","du","brevet","frais","officiels","et","honoraires","d","agents","de","brevets","2","avocats","les","conseils","juridiques","en","propriete","intellectuelle","qui","protegent","le","dossier","3","domaine","le","nom","de","domaine","du","site","et","ses","renouvellements","4","site","le","developpement","du","site","outils","hebergement","et","ce","qui","le","fait","prosperer","5","recherche","l","approfondissement","des","recherches","verifications","aux","sources","preuves","et","ancrages","publics","6","conformite","garder","le","site","conforme","aux","lois","qu","il","enseigne","a","commencer","par","la","loi","25","7","besoin","la","ou","le","besoin","est","le","plus","grand","au","choix","du","chercheur"],"empreinte":"e37d3310cc16c838549eb7e2814cb2610631bb165f28f418181c74adb32cf89d","merkle":{"feuille":116,"chemin":[{"cote":"droite","digest":"8fb3d1eb8be4b88a10e81e4143e146977d5ae9c8e8204f1ef5465285ba5671cf"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"50a65fd5f6bd020489c815aa5fd46da5211c62cd5d69d27c587eabed73dc6b1e"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"7a1eaf2bdb9a280fdc57481ecddde2061010da0890601045e